        "created_at": "2012-12-07T15:50:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Atlantis - Ancient power sources discovered, could use it to improve pike industries</p><p>Mars - Wagner Mars Base was sponsored by Pike, that they may profit from discoveries made there.</p><p>Egyptian Tomb - Pike is always looking for more ways to be immortal.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Fight him anywhere! Last time we fought him on Insula Primalis under the guise of him opening Jurassic Park.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rook City is the hardest environment.</p>",
