        "created_at": "2012-12-08T09:19:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I do find fighting the Chairman in Tomb of Anubis. Especially when he plays Rook City is mine. I imagine him getsuclating and then a spike trap and a giant mummy take out his underbosses. Classic.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But as to the question, I really tend to avoid Rook City, as I don't want to be jacked by both the villian <em>and</em> the enviornment deck. I also think I won't play Nightmist and Unity together. I don't think they get along, especially with oblivion killing all of Unity's friends.&nbsp;</p>",
